OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist who filmed himself at
OL,4,A189mph jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist who filmed himself
OL,7,Friding at 189mph (304km/h) and goading
OL,8,Fpolice into high-speed pursuits has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FAmin Belechguer, of Poynders Gardens in
OL,12,FClapham, London, was sentenced to four
OL,13,Fyears at Maidstone Crown Court on
OL,14,FWednesday after pleading guilty to 22
OL,15,Fcounts of dangerous driving.
OL,17,FKent Police said Belechguer was spotted
OL,18,Friding a Kawasaki Ninja H2R motorcycle
OL,19,Falong the A20 Ashford Road towards
OL,20,FMaidstone without a registration plate
OL,21,Fon 27 June 2025.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
