OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers were en route to a
OL,7,Fseparate incident with lights and
OL,8,Fsirens activated when the 29-year-old
OL,9,Fpulled in front of them and "began
OL,10,Fslowing and waved at the officers to
OL,11,Fgoad them into a pursuit".
